ROOT CAUSE
OpenLane 2.3.10 step 5/78 (Yosys.JsonHeader) calls:
  yosys -y /path/to/json_header.py -- --config-in ... --extra-in ... --output ...
The -y flag passes a Python script to Yosys's embedded pyosys interpreter.
This requires Yosys compiled with ENABLE_PYOSYS=1.
Homebrew Yosys (0.64 and 0.65) is built without pyosys support — the flag does
not exist in the binary.

